ok 1 - List of scores
ok 2 - Latest score
ok 3 - Personal best
ok 4 - Top 3 scores: Personal top three from a list of scores
ok 5 - Top 3 scores: Personal top highest to lowest
ok 6 - Top 3 scores: Personal top when there is a tie
ok 7 - Top 3 scores: Personal top when there are less than 3
ok 8 - Top 3 scores: Personal top when there is only one
ok 9 - Top 3 scores: Latest score after personal top scores
ok 10 - Top 3 scores: Scores after personal top scores
ok 11 - Top 3 scores: Latest score after personal best
ok 12 - Top 3 scores: Scores after personal best
